      "content": "thanks for that. i was worried about the blood meal being too aggressive. i'm also curious about the release rate though—how much of a difference are we talking in terms of days or weeks for the nitrogen to actually become available to the kale roots? also, are there any specific microbes or soil biology things i should be looking for to make sure the bone meal actually breaks down properly?",
