      "content": "makes sense. you mentioned microbial activity and things like bacteria and fungi... i've always found the way soil works to be kind of mysterious. it's like there's this whole hidden world happening right under our feet that we can't even see. do you think there's more to the \"unseen\" side of soil health than just the chemistry and the microbes we can measure?",
